1386:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *
1387:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   This function can be used by the user application to compute the
